$Descr User 15600 11300
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "DC-Modules — Control Card (GD32G553VET6, one card for both converter roles)"
Date "2026-09-06"
Rev "D.3"
Comp "DC-Modules 30/60 kW - board Control card, sheet 3 of 3"
Comment1 "Module 30/60 kW = two-board sandwich: sheet 1 AC-DC (lower) + sheet 2 DC-DC (upper), bolted DCP/DCN/PE studs + 16-way control harness"
Comment2 "Content: role-agnostic: AC-DC or DC-DC slot via ROLE straps"
Comment3 "8 functional sections - 45 components - cross-section links are global net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, CUSTOM = made to drawing)"
$EndDescr
Text Notes 600 10600 0    60   ~ 12
30/60 kW Control card - 3 of 3   ·   rev D.3   ·   8 sections   ·   45 components
